---
import PageTitle from "../components/PageTitle.astro";
import PublicLayout from "../layouts/PublicLayout.astro";
---

<PublicLayout title="Project" description="Repositories, roadmap, support policy, and credits for Verge Kit.">
  <main class="pb-16">
    <article class="prose mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <PageTitle>Project</PageTitle>


      <h2>Repositories</h2>
      <table>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><a href="https://github.com/vergekit/vergekit">vergekit/vergekit</a></td><td>Main application boilerplate and reference stack.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><a href="https://github.com/vergekit/core">vergekit/core</a></td><td>Shared core utilities for Verge Kit projects.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><a href="https://github.com/vergekit/create-vergekit">vergekit/create-vergekit</a></td><td>Project creation and installation script.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><a href="https://github.com/vergekit/docs">vergekit/docs</a></td><td>Public documentation site.</td></tr>
          <tr><td><a href="https://github.com/vergekit/janitorial">vergekit/janitorial</a></td><td>Maintenance scripts and repository utilities.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2>Project links</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://trello.com/b/PKTGLTis/verge-kit">Roadmap</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/4j440rzgyno0mgqt3lrae/AOPE27BDTBCbTsU2o5qx1WI?rlkey=l57r1ifm7m08k6telhvkc8m69&dl=0">Shared project files</a></li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Personnel</h2>
      <p>Verge Kit is produced and maintained by <a href="https://jonathanyoungblood.com/">Jonathan Youngblood</a>.</p>

      <h2>Support</h2>
      <p>
        Verge Kit is maintained as a technical starting point rather than a managed application support service. If you find a reproducible defect in the boilerplate, please <a href="https://github.com/vergekit/vergekit/issues">open an issue</a> with the Verge Kit version, runtime environment, reproduction steps, and expected and actual behavior.
      </p>
      <p>Debugging application-specific changes and implementation consulting are outside the project’s support scope.</p>

      <h2>Contributing</h2>
      <p>
        This project is not currently accepting external feature contributions or pull requests. This keeps the reference stack focused and its implementation decisions consistent. Clear bug reports are welcome through the issue tracker.
      </p>

      <h2>License</h2>
      <p>Verge Kit is available under the <a href="https://opensource.org/license/mit/">MIT License</a>.</p>

    </article>
  </main>
</PublicLayout>
